        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we have provided services in 27 states.",
        "start_character": 30597,
        "end_character": 30661
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following the closing of our initial public offering (“IPO”) in November 2025, we built a dedicated sales and marketing team that generated over 13,000 units of pipeline in less than three months.",
        "start_character": 1431,
        "end_character": 1627
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are able to appropriately scale our business, we believe we could achieve up to 70% and 75% of gross margin in our Managed Services and Network-as-a-Service lines of business, respectively.",
        "start_character": 3244,
        "end_character": 3439
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pipeline opportunities could be prevented from converting into sales if we are not able to remain competitive in developing our proposals or executing on our backlog, if there is a slowdown in new construction for multifamily projects, if we are unable to access adequate capital to deploy for Network-as-a-Service buildouts or to develop our direct sales and marketing team, if our potential customers prefer a business model other than what we offer, or if our proposed service is viewed unfavorably compared to our competitors.",
        "start_character": 18969,
        "end_character": 19499
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since relaunching in 2022, we have seen the pipeline for our services develop rapidly.",
        "start_character": 15646,
        "end_character": 15732
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our Managed Services solution, we enter into network service agreements, pursuant to which customers fund all network design and installation costs, with which we receive a gross margin on design and network installation costs.",
        "start_character": 8476,
        "end_character": 8711
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under our network services agreements, if a customer terminates the contract without cause, the customer will pay a termination fee equal to (i) any one-time termination fees we incur through termination of service provider contracts (without markup) at the property, provided that the customer may, in its sole discretion, elect to take assignment of such service provider contracts rather than paying the one-time non-terminable fees, in which case we will immediately assign the contracts to the customer, plus (ii) 25% of remaining service fees owed to us during the initial term.",
        "start_character": 8931,
        "end_character": 9515
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe a very large majority of the larger multifamily developments are now routinely constructed using the services of a Managed Services provider like Elauwit to design, install, and manage a built-in private fiber and WiFi network from which property owners sell residential Internet access services from day one.",
        "start_character": 13539,
        "end_character": 13859
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our win rate in these competitive processes is in the top three of all Managed Services providers we compete against regularly.",
        "start_character": 33557,
        "end_character": 33695
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037748",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037748-0365b03e08f8bb62",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037748",
